Changes from that work (2026): new BroadLink protocol layer (lib/broadlink)
replacing kiwicam-broadlinkjs-rm; reply validation, adaptive timeouts and
automatic re-authentication; dependency removal; Homebridge 2 fixes; latency
fixes in the air-conditioner accessory; Homebridge UI settings page with
device discovery and code learning. See CHANGELOG.md for details.

Device type identifiers were cross-checked against python-broadlink
(https://github.com/mjg59/python-broadlink, MIT License). No code from it is
included; test vectors in test/fixtures were generated with it.
